  "description": "Overview Welcome to Hacktober HackDays , an open-source building experience by SheBuilds Delhi Chapter, powered by MLH and supported by our technology partners. This October, move beyond tutorials and build something meaningful. Join fellow student developers to solve real-world problems using open-source tools, explore Cloudinary-powered technology, document your entire journey on Notion, and showcase your work to industry experts. Important: Your project must use Cloudinary, and your project documentation and building journey must be maintained on Notion. What awaits you? Hands-on building mentorship and support. A grand finale at PWIOI, Noida, on 31 October 2026. A ₹1,00,000 cash prize pool and amazing goodies :) Team size: 2–4 students. Register your team, start building, learn in public, and turn your ideas into solutions that matter.",
