    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Welcome to <strong>Hacktober HackDays</strong>, an open-source building experience by SheBuilds Delhi Chapter, powered by MLH and supported by our technology partners.</p>\n<p>This October, move beyond tutorials and build something meaningful. Join fellow student developers to solve real-world problems using open-source tools, explore Cloudinary-powered technology, document your entire journey on Notion, and showcase your work to industry experts.</p>\n<p><strong>Important:</strong> Your project must use Cloudinary, and your project documentation and building journey must be maintained on Notion.</p>\n<p><strong>What awaits you?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hands-on building mentorship and support.</li>\n<li>A grand finale at PWIOI, Noida, on 31 October 2026.</li>\n<li>A ₹1,00,000 cash prize pool and amazing goodies :)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Team size:</strong> 2&ndash;4 students.</p>\n<p>Register your team, start building, learn in public, and turn your ideas into solutions that matter.</p>",
